    <constraint source="project">SCOPE: this is a verification/enforcement task — it MUST NOT add new open surfaces; if it finds a record-driven path on `surfaceLaunchRegistry`, it repoints that path to `openSpaarkeAi` (a fix), not a registry addition.</constraint>
  </constraints>

